  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **WORLD EATERS** as your Army Faction, at the start of each battle round you may make a Blessings of Khorne roll:\n\n1. Roll 8 D6.\n2. Spend the dice on up to 2 different Blessings, activating each with the dice it lists; a stated number means a double or triple showing at least that number.\n3. Discard any dice left over.\n\nEach die pays for 1 Blessing at most, and each Blessing can be activated once per battle round. For the rest of the battle round, every activated Blessing applies to each unit of yours with this ability:\n\n- **Unbridled Bloodlust** (any double): +1 to **charge rolls**.\n- **Rage-Fuelled Invigoration** (double 2+): its models' Pile-in and Consolidation moves can go up to 6\" rather than 3\".\n- **Total Carnage** (double 3+): each time a melee attack destroys a model in the unit that is yet to fight this phase, roll a D6; on a 4+ it stays in play, can fight once the attacking unit finishes its attacks, then is removed.\n- **Martial Excellence** (double 4+ or any triple): its models' melee weapons have **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- **Warp Blades** (double 5+ or triple 2+): its models' melee weapons have **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**.\n- **Decapitating Strikes** (double 6 or triple 3+): its models' melee attacks against **INFANTRY** units have **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)**.",
